population from the Birmingham & West Midlands area, with many aspiring Birmingham-based Personal Trainers choosing to study with us. We also have many graduates go on to have fantastic careers as Personal Trainers in and around Birmingham and the West Midlands.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Our state of the art online learning means that yoiu can study our courses from Birmingham and there are then numerous Gyms in tghe Birmingham area that you can record your practical assessment from. Finally due to our unique partnership with The Gym Group, you are guarenteed an interview at any The Gym Group venue in Birmingham!</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-4 gf_col-md-4 gf_col-sm-4 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1717602603014" data-id="1717602603014"><div data-label="Google Maps" data-key="google_maps" data-atomgroup="module" id="m-1718477439448" class="module-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-googlemaps" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1718477439448" style=""><div class="module gf_google-map " data-title="" data-location="address" data-latitude="51.5256447" data-longitude="-0.0836529999" data-address="Birmingham" data-height="300px" data-mapzoom-lg="6" data-mapzoom-md="13" data-mapzoom-sm="12" data-mapzoom-xs="11" data-views="map" data-mapdefault="0" data-maincolor="#2d313f" data-mapsaturation="-20" data-mapbrightness="5" data-customkey="0" data-api-key=""><div class="gf_google-container"><div class="gf_warning_container"><p class="gf_warning_title">You are in advanced mode.</p><p class="gf_warning_content">You can turn it off in left sidebar. To use advanced options, you will need to enter your own Google Maps API  Key.</p><a class="gf_warning_button" href="https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/get-api-key">Get Google API Key</a></div></div></div><div class="gf_gmaps-overlay"></div></div></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1717591600821" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpic