4" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-left-xs gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><span style="font-weight: bold;">What opportunities are there for Personal Trainers in Birmingham?</span></p><p><span style="font-weight: bold;"><br></span></p><p>There is huge potential for Personal Trainers in Birmingham. Looking at the demographics it can be seen that over 1.1 million people live in Birmingham with close to three million in the wider West Midlands area. The health & fitness sector is truly booming within the Birmingham area with numerous gyms operating from the City.</p><p><br></p><p><span style="font-weight: bold;">What gyms do Birmingham Personal Trainers work from?</span></p><p><span style="font-weight: bold;"><br></span></p><p>There are many gyms within Birmingham and the West Midlands area including:</p><p><br></p><p>•	The Gym Group</p><p>•	Virgin Active</p><p>•	Everlast Fitness</p><p>•	Everyone Active</p><p>•	Anytime Fitness</p><p>•	Pure Gym</p><p><br></p><p>These gyms are actively recruiting newly qualified Birmingham-based Personal Trainer course graduates. As Study Active works in partnership with these gyms there is huge potential for you to become a Personal Trainer in Birmingham.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Can I get a job a a Personal Trainer at a Birmingham gym?</strong></p><p><strong><br></strong></p><p>Study Active has a unique partnership with The Gym Group. This partnership sees our graduates obtain a guarenteed interview and site visit for any The Gym Group venue in the UK. For Birmingham there are a total of 11 The Gym Group sites to choose from (please see the list on this page), the largest being:</p><p><br></p><p><strong>The Gym Group Birmingham City Centre, 79-84 High Street, Birmingham, West Midlands, B4 7TE</strong></p><p><br></p><p>To arrange for site vist and guarenteed interview at any The Gym Group Birmingham locations please enquire <u><a href="https://st